      "claim": "The doctor owed the father a duty of care because a doctor‑patient relationship was established when the doctor treated the father at the hospital.",
      "evidence": "The mother called the family doctor, who met the father at the hospital and provided treatment, creating a legal doctor‑patient relationship.",
      "weight": 0.20,
